# vvaharness/remediation_agent/artifacts/diff/derive.py

The single choice between a real `git diff` and the synthesized fallback, so the recorded diff is the harness's own account of the change, not the engine's.

Source: `vvaharness/remediation_agent/artifacts/diff/derive.py` (lines 1-34)
Executor: code
Called from: `plugin_runner/run.sudo` (diff capture after the engine call)

// src: vvaharness/remediation_agent/artifacts/diff/derive.py:27-34
fn derive_diff(repo, snapshot, changed):executor=code {
  diff = gitcapture.capture_git_diff(repo, changed, baseline=snapshot)   // the snapshot baseline scopes the diff to this case's own edits, not an earlier case's
  if (!diff && snapshot != null) diff = synth.synth_unified_diff(repo, snapshot, extra_files=changed)
  return diff or ""
}
